   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Giving an opinion",
     "texto": [
      "**Menurut saya** introduces an opinion (\"in my opinion\"). Then you can say **Saya setuju** (I agree) or **Saya tidak setuju** (I don't agree) and add a reason."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Talking about benefits",
     "texto": [
      "**Manfaatnya** is formed with **manfaat** + **-nya** and means \"its benefit\". **Pun** stays separate and can add the idea of \"also\": **Relawan pun menanam pohon**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
